      "description": "Link sidebar panel 32px; aktif = slate-100 dengan ikon aksen.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-a ds-on\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"7\" height=\"9\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"16\" width=\"7\" height=\"5\"/></svg>Ringkasan</a><a class=\"ds-nav-a\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 2 2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z\"/><path d=\"m2 17 10 5 10-5\"/><path d=\"m2 12 10 5 10-5\"/></svg>Ujian</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:'Inter Variable',system-ui,sans-serif;width:216px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}.ds-nav-a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;height:32px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#475569;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s}.ds-nav-a svg{color:#94a3b8}.ds-nav-a:hover{background:#f8fafc;color:#0f172a}.ds-nav-a.ds-on{background:#f1f5f9;color:#0f172a}.ds-nav-a.ds-on svg{color:var(--accent,#2563eb)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigator Soal",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "nav-cell-answered",
      "description": "Tile status soal; terbaca tanpa warna lewat isi, garis, tanda sudut.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-navg\"><button class=\"ds-cell ds-ans\">1</button><button class=\"ds-cell ds-flag\">2</button><button class=\"ds-cell\">3</button><button class=\"ds-cell ds-cur\">4</button><button class=\"ds-cell ds-ans\">5</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-navg{font-family:'Inter Variable',system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,52px);gap:6px}.ds-cell{position:relative;height:36px;border:0;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;background:#fff;color:#334155;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #cbd5e1;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s}.ds-cell:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #94a3b8}.ds-ans{background:var(--accent,#2563eb);color:var(--accent-fg,#fff);box-shadow:none}.ds-ans:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--accent,#2563eb) 84%,black);box-shadow:none}.ds-flag{background:#fcd34d;color:#451a03;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #f59e0b}.ds-flag::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;right:0;border-left:7px solid transparent;border-top:7px solid #b45309}.ds-cur{outline:2px solid #0f172a;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pill Simpan",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "save-pill",
      "description": "Status simpan yang selalu membawa bukti (jam sinkron / antrean).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-save\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span>Tersimpan <span class=\"ds-at\">02.47</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-save{font-family:'Inter Variable',system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:32px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:#ecfdf5;color:#065f46;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #a7f3d0;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer}.ds-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:9999px;background:#10b981}.ds-at{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;opacity:.7}.ds-save:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2563eb);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Opsi Jawaban",
